eudi_lib_core_crypto
Copyright (c) 2026 the eudi_lib_core_crypto contributors

This product is a Cangjie (仓颉) crypto wrap layer for the EU Digital Identity
Wallet on HarmonyOS: ECDSA P-256, ECDH, HKDF, AES-GCM, digests, JWS and
base64url primitives backed by Cangjie stdx.crypto.

This product depends on the following third-party software:

  - cangjie-stdx (Apache License 2.0) — Cangjie extended standard library,
    including stdx.crypto. Not vendored; supplied by the consuming app.

  - OpenSSL runtime libraries (Apache License 2.0), loaded by stdx.crypto at
    runtime. Not vendored; supplied by the consuming app.

